# Unity-generated YAML and mesh dumps produce huge, unreviewable line diffs (one Nyx idle
# swap was 1.3M lines) that time out diff viewers such as T3's commit panel. Show them as
# binary in `git diff`; use `git diff --text -- <path>` when you really need the lines.
# Only diff output changes: storage, merges and history are unaffected.
*.anim   -diff linguist-generated
*.obj    -diff linguist-generated
*.prefab -diff linguist-generated
*.unity  -diff linguist-generated
